# Phase 5 (CTRLO-WIDER): the scalars fx and xfx count alike that a
# terminal draws wider (src/tui/drawn_wider.rs): U+261D, U+2E3A and U+1F590,
# U+E0002 (counted as none), U+FE0F after `a`, a soft hyphen, U+FFA0 and
# U+FFF0, and U+2065 -- one line short; two that reach the 112-cell text row
# at its last cell by the count, U+261D and then `a` U+FE0F, each just before
# `TAIL5678`; and one with four U+261D at its front, 100 `w`, `TAIL`, six `w`
# and `END`, the row's 112 cells and five more by the count. The first line
# changes. Each line takes as many rows named as raw, so neither side's
# Ctrl-O screen pushes a row off the other's. Read first on both sides, then
# Ctrl-O over the change.
gateway p5-ctrlo-wider-diff-fam-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
work p5-ctrlo-wider-diff-famws
keep
until shown Full access
until gone Full access
type edit the file
wait 1
key Enter
until shown Edited.
until gone Generating (
snap edited
key C-o
until shown full detail
snap full
wire full
key C-o
until gone full detail
snap closed
gwlog
